O'Donnell. <\/p><p>With the rich flavour of pomegranate, complemented by bright citrus notes, this is the perfect year-round flavour, working in everything from sparkling summer spritzers to warming winter punches.<\/p><p>Grab a jar now a discover that there's more to this exotic fruit than just salads and Grenadine.<\/p><p>Bottled in traditional Mason Jars, we promise a unique drinking experience. If you would like to discover more <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">high quality liqueurs<\/a>, have a look at our entire product range and become part of our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\" target=\"_blank\">Moonshine Gang<\/a> to collect proof points and get unique benefits.<\/p><p>Curious? Simply order your O'Donnell Lime today and we'll ship it to anywhere within mainland UK within a few working days.<br\/><br\/><strong>Please note: All of our products are shipped in branded boxes.<\/strong><\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_tab_J9RkzV":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Perfect Serve","icon":"bottle","content":"<h3>Pomegranate Lemonade<\/h3><p>To a glass with ice add your Pomegranate liqueur and top with sparkling lemonade.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_tab_VnTtPh":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. All of our products, unless stated otherwise, are suitable for vegans and those with a gluten intolerance.<\/p><p>All of our spirits are produced using wheat based alcohol. While the distillation process removes gluten from the final product, individuals with certain conditions (i.e coeliac disease) may wish to exercise caution prior to purchase.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_tab_R8hVML":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":